  "instructions": [
    "In a medium saucepan, bring the water to a boil over high heat.",
    "Add the mixed herb marinade to the saucepan and stir to combine.",
    "Add the quinoa, brown rice, and bulgur to the saucepan, and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 18 minutes.",
    "While the grains are cooking, toast the almonds in a dry skillet over medium heat until fragrant.",
    "While the grains are cooking, mix the chopped fresh mint into a small bowl.",
    "Once the grains are cooked, fluff with a fork and stir in the toasted almonds, dried cranberries, and toasted pumpkin seeds.",
    "Stir in the lemon juice and olive oil, and season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer the grains to a large serving bowl and top with the mixed herb marinade (see below)."
